cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite this project. This record is software metadata, not a peer-reviewed publication."
title: "Seq2Lead: auditable protein–ligand ranking and historical BindingDB evaluation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rizvanov
    given-names: Rinat
    affiliation: "Boston University, Boston, MA, USA"
repository-code: "https://github.com/rinatrizvanov/seq2lead"
license: MIT
license-url: "https://github.com/rinatrizvanov/seq2lead/blob/main/LICENSE"
version: "0.3.0"
abstract: "Ranks a frozen compound library against one protein sequence, with a
  leakage-controlled historical BindingDB benchmark whose predictions, labels and
  verification records are published. The MIT licence covers the project code only;
  shipped data derived from BindingDB carries its own terms in DATA_LICENSE."
